WEBVTT

00:45.254 --> 00:48.966
PERFECT CROWN

00:59.851 --> 01:01.060
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

01:01.061 --> 01:02.980
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

01:16.618 --> 01:18.579
All rise
for His Majesty the King!

02:06.251 --> 02:08.378
Let us begin the discussion on abolishing…

02:10.255 --> 02:11.256
the monarchy.

02:22.184 --> 02:25.479
PERFECT CROWN

02:33.487 --> 02:34.946
So… No, no.

02:44.998 --> 02:47.375
He should have told them by now, right?

02:47.376 --> 02:48.459
Yes, he should have.

02:48.460 --> 02:51.504
The court historians
must've recorded it by now, right?

02:51.505 --> 02:53.923
Once it's in the records,
it's set in stone.

02:53.924 --> 02:55.132
We're in trouble now.

02:55.133 --> 02:57.843
This won't do. I'll call Hyejeong…
I mean, Aide Do--

02:57.844 --> 02:58.845
Just shush!

03:06.269 --> 03:09.398
Tomorrow, you'll be His Majesty,
and not His Royal Highness.

03:10.941 --> 03:12.566
You'll also be Queen tomorrow,

03:12.567 --> 03:13.777
and not the Grand Princess.

03:15.821 --> 03:17.614
What will you record first in the Annals?

03:21.326 --> 03:24.286
On the day the newly crowned king
first enters the Throne Hall,

03:24.287 --> 03:27.457
all are assembled,
from the Cabinet to the royal family.

03:28.166 --> 03:30.502
Like a traditional ceremony of sorts?

03:31.420 --> 03:33.088
With all the court historians too.

03:34.047 --> 03:35.131
Yeah.

03:35.132 --> 03:37.467
I didn't even know this was a big deal.

03:38.093 --> 03:39.510
I've seen so many gatherings.

03:41.972 --> 03:44.641
That's because we caused them
a great deal of trouble.

03:48.687 --> 03:49.688
So?

03:50.772 --> 03:52.858
What will be
your first proclamation as King?
:cue

04:04.244 --> 04:05.829
Words that…

04:09.583 --> 04:10.834
carry great weight.

04:15.589 --> 04:17.048
The backlash could be severe.

04:19.634 --> 04:21.052
But still, I'm sure you…

04:22.137 --> 04:23.472
I will understand you.

04:32.981 --> 04:34.357
I'm going to abolish the Crown.

04:38.528 --> 04:39.738
Inherited titles and status

04:40.405 --> 04:41.948
can become a privilege

04:42.949 --> 04:43.950
or a constraint.

04:46.828 --> 04:48.079
It all stems from the Crown.

04:55.879 --> 04:57.547
I thought it was treason.

05:01.134 --> 05:02.469
Turns out it was a revolution.

05:03.887 --> 05:04.888
Your dream.

05:18.568 --> 05:19.986
You've just attained this title.

05:20.821 --> 05:22.571
Are you ready to let it go?

05:22.572 --> 05:26.409
I never said I wanted status.

05:27.869 --> 05:30.330
I was just pissed off
about the opportunities it cost me.

05:36.044 --> 05:37.254
That's when I knew.

05:39.047 --> 05:40.048
That you'd be…

05:41.591 --> 05:42.592
my revolution.

06:01.611 --> 06:02.779
Your Majesty.

06:03.363 --> 06:04.822
Abolition of the monarchy?

06:04.823 --> 06:06.366
You cannot mean what you say.

06:06.867 --> 06:09.660
Every year, most nations
with constitutional monarchies

06:09.661 --> 06:11.787
revisit the question
of their own abolition.

06:11.788 --> 06:13.706
But that is…

06:13.707 --> 06:15.166
Prime Minister Min.

06:15.876 --> 06:16.959
Yes, Your Majesty.

06:16.960 --> 06:18.795
What about our country?

06:19.379 --> 06:23.257
We conduct formal opinion polls,
but opposition remains high every year.

06:23.258 --> 06:25.260
I believe the divide is not so vast.

06:26.970 --> 06:28.346
For a decade now,

06:29.097 --> 06:30.848
that gap has steadily narrowed.

06:30.849 --> 06:33.602
The Crown does not exist
to prove its worth.

06:35.687 --> 06:38.315
Its value lies in its very existence.

06:46.323 --> 06:49.284
"We do not need a king
who lacks the people's support."

06:50.410 --> 06:51.828
I believe those were your words.

06:54.831 --> 06:55.832
Have you forgotten?

07:08.887 --> 07:10.347
Kings may come and go…

07:16.186 --> 07:17.687
but the Crown endures.

07:24.027 --> 07:26.195
You're saying the Cabinet
and Royal Relatives

07:26.196 --> 07:28.073
will oppose it, no question?

07:28.698 --> 07:29.948
Yes.

07:29.949 --> 07:33.410
Most of the establishment
is connected to the Crown.

07:33.411 --> 07:36.580
The monarchy and the political world
have always sustained each other.

07:36.581 --> 07:38.667
The Royal Relatives go without saying.

07:40.877 --> 07:42.629
So His Majesty has nothing to rely on

07:43.838 --> 07:45.382
but public sentiment.
:cue

07:50.011 --> 07:51.470
- There he is!
- He's here!

07:54.933 --> 07:57.184
Is it true there are talks
of abolishing the monarchy?

07:57.185 --> 07:58.895
Is this your first time hearing about it?

08:04.275 --> 08:05.943
The people of this nation

08:05.944 --> 08:08.196
have nothing to worry about.

08:09.197 --> 08:11.115
Please say more!

08:11.116 --> 08:12.616
One more statement, please!

08:16.287 --> 08:19.289
The release
of the 34th monarch's first agenda

08:19.290 --> 08:21.458
has triggered a major stir.

08:21.459 --> 08:25.045
This agenda starts the discussion
on the abolition of the monarchy.

08:25.046 --> 08:27.464
As Prime Minister Min left the palace,

08:27.465 --> 08:29.091
he reassured the public…

08:29.092 --> 08:30.551
He just ascended the throne.

08:30.552 --> 08:32.553
Why would he abolish the monarchy?

08:32.554 --> 08:33.637
I know, right?

08:33.638 --> 08:35.849
Do you think Father knows about this?

08:36.474 --> 08:37.851
Damn it…

09:17.348 --> 09:19.934
How dare you show your face here?

09:22.854 --> 09:24.606
I wanted to see for myself

09:25.899 --> 09:27.775
the gravity of the sins I have committed.

09:27.776 --> 09:30.695
Do you even realize what you have done?

09:32.072 --> 09:35.033
I'm asking if it feels good
to cast aside your own father and son.

09:37.118 --> 09:39.412
Have you no pity for that poor boy,

09:40.789 --> 09:44.459
now cast into the shadows
like some relic of a bygone age?

09:46.878 --> 09:48.004
That poor boy…

09:51.049 --> 09:52.425
knew everything all along.

09:55.053 --> 09:57.222
He knew the full measure of my sins,

09:58.932 --> 10:01.434
and he silently shouldered
that heavy burden.

10:02.018 --> 10:03.185
What are you saying?

10:03.186 --> 10:05.021
Do you know how I felt

10:06.189 --> 10:08.691
when I learned of your sins?

10:12.737 --> 10:14.614
When you so proudly claimed

10:15.907 --> 10:17.450
that it was all for my sake.

10:19.702 --> 10:22.914
Do you know how that made me feel?

10:30.088 --> 10:31.089
So…

10:33.133 --> 10:35.135
may this mark the end of your sins.

10:36.886 --> 10:38.054
From this day forth…

10:42.058 --> 10:43.476
you have no daughter to claim.

10:57.657 --> 10:58.700
Your Majesty!

11:01.995 --> 11:03.621
Prime Minister Min, that bastard…

11:14.883 --> 11:16.718
He knew about the explosion

11:17.719 --> 11:20.471
when he drew
the Grand Prince to that place.

11:22.974 --> 11:25.602
You must stop either
the Grand Prince or His Majesty.

11:26.936 --> 11:28.104
Do whatever you must.

12:08.937 --> 12:09.938
Let me escort you

12:10.939 --> 12:12.523
back to the palace.

12:22.075 --> 12:24.994
MY SON
:cue

12:35.380 --> 12:36.463
There he is.

12:36.464 --> 12:37.547
Father.

12:37.548 --> 12:40.884
Is it true what they're saying
about abolishing the monarchy?

12:40.885 --> 12:42.302
- They're not, right?
- Are they?

12:42.303 --> 12:44.096
How can they abolish the Crown?

12:44.097 --> 12:45.890
Father, say something.

12:48.518 --> 12:50.936
My brother-in-law just
became King.

12:50.937 --> 12:53.230
How can they abolish it already?

12:53.231 --> 12:55.065
- "Brother-in-law"?
- Why? What's wrong?

12:55.066 --> 12:56.900
He is my brother-in-law, right?

12:56.901 --> 12:58.403
Address him properly.

12:58.945 --> 13:00.904
You don't want to get people talking.

13:00.905 --> 13:02.281
Let's not kid ourselves.

13:02.282 --> 13:04.491
There's no title to speak of
if there's no Crown.

13:04.492 --> 13:06.868
You just became Lord JUNGHWA.
You're finally a lord--

13:06.869 --> 13:07.954
Taeju!

13:13.710 --> 13:15.503
For the time being,

13:16.921 --> 13:18.006
watch your backs.

13:20.049 --> 13:21.133
Our backs?

13:21.134 --> 13:24.136
Why would you say
something like that, Father?

13:24.137 --> 13:25.179
You're scaring me.

13:29.183 --> 13:30.184
Wait…

13:36.774 --> 13:39.819
There will be another discussion
on the monarchy's abolition next week.

13:40.695 --> 13:43.406
His Majesty will seek to leave
that decision to the people.

13:44.198 --> 13:45.450
The Cabinet will oppose it.

13:46.534 --> 13:49.454
I'll need you
to voice your objection there.

13:55.460 --> 13:57.170
I am powerless.

13:59.756 --> 14:01.382
I'm not asking you to exercise power.

14:02.175 --> 14:04.259
Simply hint that the abolition
of the monarchy

14:04.260 --> 14:08.097
is His Majesty's own pursuit,
not the will of the Crown.

14:08.848 --> 14:09.932
And if I refuse?

14:11.434 --> 14:13.144
What will happen then?

14:18.691 --> 14:21.611
Do you wish to see your only son
follow in your father's footsteps…

14:24.322 --> 14:25.823
and be branded a criminal as well?

14:39.587 --> 14:40.797
Your Majesty.

14:42.548 --> 14:44.341
Prime Minister Min is not holding back.

14:44.342 --> 14:46.427
The palace budget has been put on hold.

14:52.308 --> 14:55.477
I knew he'd try to rein us in,
but I expected a different approach.

14:55.478 --> 14:57.521
Snipping the purse strings was a low blow.

14:57.522 --> 14:59.689
This will immobilize
the Queen's Quarters first.

14:59.690 --> 15:02.026
The royal finances are
under the Queen's jurisdiction.

15:02.652 --> 15:05.446
She just became Queen
and is already set to come under fire.

15:05.947 --> 15:07.323
What's the most pressing issue?

15:07.907 --> 15:09.325
The palace attendants' salaries.

15:09.867 --> 15:11.869
The Royal Guard
and administrative officials…

15:12.954 --> 15:13.955
:cue

15:14.664 --> 15:15.665
Excuse me.

15:16.791 --> 15:17.959
I'm Seong Huiju.

15:18.584 --> 15:20.335
The only money problems I've had were,

15:20.336 --> 15:22.963
"Gosh, how am I ever going
to spend all this money?"

15:22.964 --> 15:24.297
That's it.

15:24.298 --> 15:26.383
So what? Will you donate to the Crown?

15:26.384 --> 15:27.884
Yeah.

15:27.885 --> 15:29.137
What?

15:29.846 --> 15:33.223
What's the point of having wealthy in-laws
if you can't make use of them?

15:33.224 --> 15:36.059
- Let me see. How short is the budget?
- Well, this is…

15:36.060 --> 15:38.521
I appreciate the sentiment, but no.

15:39.021 --> 15:40.730
We need to think long-term.

15:40.731 --> 15:43.191
We can't think long-term right now.

15:43.192 --> 15:44.735
I already told you.

15:45.236 --> 15:47.362
When you pursue
a venture everyone opposes,

15:47.363 --> 15:49.699
you can't give them the time to object.

15:54.412 --> 15:56.247
PRIME MINISTER MIN JEONGWOO

15:56.873 --> 15:59.875
The Crown must've been up in arms.
Thank you for handling that.

15:59.876 --> 16:01.169
Actually, sir…

16:07.008 --> 16:10.136
The palace turned down funding
for the second half of the year.

16:12.430 --> 16:14.431
But they won't
be able to operate without it.

16:14.432 --> 16:16.850
Castle Group has made
a donation to the Crown.

16:16.851 --> 16:19.604
The amount they received
exceeds their annual budget.

16:27.028 --> 16:28.988
Look at His Majesty
making use of his in-laws.

16:30.364 --> 16:31.365
How petty.

16:36.495 --> 16:38.496
GREMLIN

16:45.671 --> 16:46.838
Hey, Dayeong.

16:46.839 --> 16:48.299
I'm a bit busy right now.

16:58.392 --> 17:00.603
What's going on? What summons?

17:02.396 --> 17:03.898
Is this intel from your family?

17:04.815 --> 17:05.899
Yes.

17:05.900 --> 17:07.776
It's a slush fund probe.

17:07.777 --> 17:11.113
They say a formal summons
will be issued within a day or two…

17:14.617 --> 17:15.618
This is clearly

17:16.869 --> 17:18.370
a direct attack on me.

17:18.371 --> 17:20.330
If you know that, don't play into it.

17:20.331 --> 17:21.332
I won't.

17:22.375 --> 17:24.502
It's a threat to deter us
from funding the Crown.

17:25.962 --> 17:27.838
Why give them the satisfaction?

17:32.134 --> 17:33.219
What's with that face?

17:34.303 --> 17:35.387
Dayeong.

17:35.388 --> 17:37.722
Can you check
who is leading the investigation?

17:37.723 --> 17:39.183
Why do you ask?

17:39.934 --> 17:41.477
I'm going to change the narrative.

17:42.061 --> 17:43.104
From slush funds

17:44.272 --> 17:45.439
to abuse of power.

17:51.404 --> 17:52.572
Well, in that case…

17:53.239 --> 17:54.782
I'll go in for questioning, Father.

17:55.324 --> 17:58.201
Are you nuts? Why would you do that?

17:58.202 --> 18:00.495
Father's blood pressure
has been acting up and all.

18:00.496 --> 18:03.582
The stress from all the questioning
might just push him over the edge.

18:03.583 --> 18:08.421
And it's only right for the successor
to handle these matters.

18:09.088 --> 18:11.548
- Babe, are you still drunk?
- Don't be absurd--

18:11.549 --> 18:13.175
Go ahead then.

18:14.176 --> 18:15.553
What?

18:17.054 --> 18:20.348
A bit of media exposure
wouldn't be the worst thing.

18:20.349 --> 18:21.767
Father.

18:22.435 --> 18:23.560
Is that all, Father?

18:23.561 --> 18:26.855
I've actually been meaning
to say this for a while now.

18:26.856 --> 18:29.983
Right now, I'm offering
to take your place in the investigation,

18:29.984 --> 18:31.318
out of pure filial devotion.

18:31.319 --> 18:34.321
I'm not asking
for tears of gratitude, am I?

18:34.322 --> 18:35.655
But maybe a little praise?

18:35.656 --> 18:36.991
Or at least a warm…

18:37.867 --> 18:38.909
What? Too far?

18:40.620 --> 18:41.703
I'm off.

18:41.704 --> 18:42.705
Wait.

18:43.664 --> 18:46.000
Don't just sit there.
Escort her back to the palace.

18:46.584 --> 18:47.877
Me? Escort who?

18:48.628 --> 18:49.629
Her?

18:56.719 --> 18:58.095
You shouldn't be out alone.

19:14.195 --> 19:15.404
What? What now?

19:15.988 --> 19:19.282
Castle Beauty's legal team
is highly capable.

19:19.283 --> 19:20.618
What?

19:21.744 --> 19:23.079
Let me know if you need help.

19:27.541 --> 19:28.625
You worried about me?

19:28.626 --> 19:30.336
You must be insane.

19:31.629 --> 19:33.129
That's not it.

19:33.130 --> 19:34.840
You're going in Father's place.

19:35.341 --> 19:36.550
So do it right.

19:37.259 --> 19:38.636
Don't give them any ammunition.

19:40.805 --> 19:43.391
Hey, I have years of experience
as a wealthy heir too.

19:44.392 --> 19:46.142
You're the only one who belittles me.

19:46.143 --> 19:47.186
Just you.

19:49.438 --> 19:50.856
I'll try to be less harsh now.

19:51.941 --> 19:53.150
Brother.

19:55.486 --> 19:56.487
"Brother"?

19:59.448 --> 20:01.617
Wait, what are you going to do?

20:02.368 --> 20:03.451
What was it?

20:03.452 --> 20:04.536
You're doing what now?

20:04.537 --> 20:06.497
:cue

20:11.711 --> 20:14.088
"I'll try to be less harsh now."

20:15.005 --> 20:18.134
No way.

20:20.678 --> 20:23.639
Your Majesty,
the Queen has arrived.

20:24.140 --> 20:25.599
Show her in.

20:33.065 --> 20:34.108
What's wrong?

20:34.692 --> 20:36.277
I'm exhausted.

20:45.369 --> 20:47.079
I went to see Father today.

20:48.998 --> 20:49.999
Your father?

20:50.833 --> 20:51.876
Nobody told me that.

20:52.460 --> 20:54.502
I slipped out alone
without telling anyone,

20:54.503 --> 20:56.255
so don't give Aide Choi a hard time.

20:58.549 --> 20:59.550
You went alone?

21:00.176 --> 21:01.594
I had no other choice.

21:02.428 --> 21:03.721
I was feeling too restless.

21:05.890 --> 21:06.932
Why?

21:14.482 --> 21:15.733
As early as tomorrow,

21:16.525 --> 21:18.694
prosecutors will begin
investigating Castle Group.

21:21.989 --> 21:23.282
Hold on. Get up--

21:26.744 --> 21:28.996
Father told me
not to play into their hands.

21:30.623 --> 21:34.877
Seong Taeju volunteered for questioning
with his chest all puffed up.

21:36.462 --> 21:37.962
It was so annoying.

21:39.048 --> 21:41.174
Why couldn't they just get angry?

21:41.175 --> 21:42.593
That would've been less awkward.

21:45.888 --> 21:46.889
Seong Huiju.

21:49.850 --> 21:51.602
Then again, you know…

21:52.186 --> 21:54.396
I mean, like…

21:55.981 --> 21:57.191
I didn't exactly hate it.

22:00.027 --> 22:01.654
It felt a bit reassuring,

22:02.446 --> 22:03.948
in a way.

22:10.663 --> 22:12.331
You should do that for me too.

22:13.833 --> 22:15.251
You should hold your ground

22:16.126 --> 22:17.336
and puff out your chest,

22:18.170 --> 22:19.420
so I can feel reassured.

22:32.768 --> 22:33.769
I will.

22:38.607 --> 22:39.608
Do it again.

22:42.194 --> 22:43.612
- Super reassuring, right?
- Yeah.

22:57.710 --> 23:00.671
Do you wish to see your only
son follow in your father's footsteps…

23:02.298 --> 23:03.799
and be branded a criminal as well?

23:12.725 --> 23:14.226
What is that supposed to mean?

23:18.689 --> 23:20.523
I'm referring to three years ago,

23:20.524 --> 23:23.027
when you disposed
of the late King's royal edict.

23:30.784 --> 23:32.702
I do not know what you are talking about--

23:32.703 --> 23:35.998
If it's revealed you defied a royal decree
to seat your son upon the throne,

23:36.999 --> 23:38.083
the abdicated King

23:39.418 --> 23:41.503
will go down in history as a criminal.

23:44.256 --> 23:46.717
Not as a king or even a royal.

23:48.093 --> 23:49.178
Just a criminal.

23:52.598 --> 23:53.599
For eternity.

23:56.268 --> 23:57.645
How dare you…

24:02.399 --> 24:03.775
I've only kept my mouth shut

24:03.776 --> 24:05.986
because I was worried
the Crown would crumble.

24:08.781 --> 24:10.616
You worry that much about the Crown…

24:14.036 --> 24:15.829
yet you tried to kill I-AN?

24:26.423 --> 24:28.384
I am willing to do whatever it takes…

24:31.011 --> 24:32.554
as many times as necessary.

24:48.654 --> 24:50.114
How difficult it is…

24:52.449 --> 24:53.909
just to keep you safe.
:cue

25:04.628 --> 25:06.129
There he is!

25:17.808 --> 25:19.559
Is it true that Castle Group maintains

25:19.560 --> 25:21.728
a slush fund
in the hundreds of billions of won?

25:21.729 --> 25:24.022
Can you explain the donation
you made to the Crown?

25:24.023 --> 25:26.482
Has the Queen reached out to you at all?

25:26.483 --> 25:28.109
Let's all calm down first.

25:28.110 --> 25:30.571
- Castle Group's slush fund…
- Let me just say this first.

25:31.739 --> 25:35.450
Well, you know, the Crown and the Cabinet

25:35.451 --> 25:38.202
just happens to be clashing
at this moment.

25:38.203 --> 25:40.621
The timing of this
seems just perfect, doesn't it?

25:40.622 --> 25:42.207
But still,

25:42.791 --> 25:45.294
I pledge to fully cooperate
with the investigation.

26:00.893 --> 26:02.186
Do you have something to say?

26:04.313 --> 26:05.314
No, Your Majesty.

26:10.277 --> 26:11.403
What is it?

26:12.071 --> 26:15.449
Perhaps you'd like
to visit the Queen Mother's Quarters?

26:18.243 --> 26:21.955
I believe you should if you want
to persuade the Office of Royal Relatives.

26:26.376 --> 26:27.544
Let her rest.

26:30.464 --> 26:32.424
She has only just ended her battle.

26:41.266 --> 26:42.726
Can you imagine it?

26:45.646 --> 26:47.773
This nation without a monarchy.

26:49.149 --> 26:50.776
I am curious.

26:55.114 --> 26:56.823
Are you not afraid?

26:56.824 --> 26:59.952
Are you afraid, Mother?

27:20.013 --> 27:21.140
That's surprising.

27:22.349 --> 27:23.683
What is?

27:23.684 --> 27:26.562
I heard she's barely left
her quarters recently.

27:27.729 --> 27:28.730
Is that so?

27:29.273 --> 27:31.191
After what happened
with Lord INPYEONG,

27:31.692 --> 27:34.736
she probably finds it difficult
to face the court attendants right now.

27:46.123 --> 27:48.125
Are you asking me for help?

27:49.751 --> 27:50.752
Yes.

27:52.546 --> 27:53.755
The royal family

27:55.173 --> 27:56.884
still listens to what you have to say.

27:59.177 --> 28:01.555
I had wondered why His Majesty
withheld his punishment.

28:04.266 --> 28:06.018
It appears he had his reasons.
:cue

28:32.502 --> 28:33.503
It is me.

28:40.427 --> 28:41.762
You made the right decision.

29:31.311 --> 29:33.605
I have reviewed
the petition you have submitted.

29:36.441 --> 29:37.900
The royal family called upon me

29:37.901 --> 29:40.070
to safeguard the realm and the dynasty.

29:41.822 --> 29:44.449
And the Cabinet implored me
to fulfill my duties as the King.

29:45.534 --> 29:47.577
Is that correct?

29:48.787 --> 29:51.539
We were simply speaking
on behalf of the public, Your Majesty.

29:51.540 --> 29:52.582
Did you bother to ask?

29:53.917 --> 29:54.960
It is my understanding…

29:56.712 --> 29:58.504
that the people were never surveyed.

30:00.090 --> 30:01.091
Your Majesty.

30:01.717 --> 30:03.844
- The Cabinet was chosen by the people--
- So?

30:04.428 --> 30:06.972
You intend to make every choice for them?

30:11.143 --> 30:12.394
"All people are equal."

30:13.478 --> 30:17.064
It is stipulated in our Constitution.
However, the existence of the Crown

30:17.065 --> 30:19.150
only serves to reinforce class divisions

30:19.151 --> 30:21.193
and undermine equality, does it not?

30:21.194 --> 30:22.319
Your Majesty, that is--

30:22.320 --> 30:23.989
Shielded by royal privileges,

30:25.365 --> 30:26.783
royal family members run amok,

30:28.702 --> 30:30.870
and the nobles aligned with them

30:30.871 --> 30:32.497
flaunt their power before the people.

30:33.290 --> 30:34.458
What do you think of this?

30:38.962 --> 30:40.255
What you seek to preserve

30:41.590 --> 30:42.632
is neither this kingdom

30:44.551 --> 30:45.594
nor the monarchy.

30:46.845 --> 30:48.597
It is merely your precious noble status.

30:56.188 --> 30:57.189
Your Majesty.

30:58.231 --> 31:01.943
Having lived a life sheltered by privilege
in an unequal world, you may not be aware.

31:02.486 --> 31:05.280
But the Crown's contribution
to the nation is not just financial.

31:05.947 --> 31:07.824
Economy, diplomacy, and culture.

31:08.325 --> 31:09.700
Its influence extends--

31:09.701 --> 31:11.078
So?

31:14.122 --> 31:15.706
Is that why you tried to kill him?

31:23.715 --> 31:26.093
Economy, diplomacy, and culture.

31:27.010 --> 31:30.262
Did the threat of abolishing
such an influential monarchy

31:30.263 --> 31:32.224
compel you to attempt to assassinate…

31:35.894 --> 31:37.437
the King of this nation?

31:38.396 --> 31:39.397
Seong Huiju.

31:42.275 --> 31:43.401
Your Majesty.
:cue

31:52.202 --> 31:53.994
RECORDING 1

31:53.995 --> 31:57.707
Do you wish to see your only
son follow in your father's footsteps…

31:58.208 --> 31:59.876
and be branded a criminal as well?

32:01.753 --> 32:03.421
What is that supposed to mean?

32:03.922 --> 32:05.756
I've only kept my mouth shut

32:05.757 --> 32:08.009
because I was worried
the Crown would crumble.

32:09.010 --> 32:11.262
You worry that much about the Crown,

32:11.263 --> 32:13.306
yet you tried to kill I-AN?

32:14.766 --> 32:17.144
I am willing to do
whatever it takes…

32:19.229 --> 32:20.897
as many times as necessary.

32:32.367 --> 32:34.035
The day I went to visit my father…

32:36.246 --> 32:37.664
Let me escort you

32:39.332 --> 32:40.875
back to the palace.

32:42.794 --> 32:44.462
MY SON

32:50.677 --> 32:53.555
This is what
Prime Minister Min had come to tell me.

32:59.603 --> 33:01.855
His Majesty cannot bring himself
to forsake mercy.

33:03.440 --> 33:05.483
However, you are different.

33:07.402 --> 33:08.987
When it comes to Prime Minister Min,

33:10.363 --> 33:11.698
no blow will cut deeper

33:12.699 --> 33:14.201
than one that comes from you.

33:36.806 --> 33:37.807
Is this…

33:39.601 --> 33:40.727
all true?

33:46.191 --> 33:47.776
Answer me!

33:48.610 --> 33:51.362
Your Majesty, perhaps we should
verify the facts first--

33:51.363 --> 33:52.572
I asked the prime minister.

33:53.156 --> 33:55.617
- Please excuse the royal family--
- From now on,

33:57.077 --> 33:58.787
anyone who defends the prime minister…

34:00.789 --> 34:02.082
shall be deemed an accomplice

34:03.708 --> 34:05.210
to the one who sought my life.

34:09.673 --> 34:11.549
Your Majesty.

34:45.041 --> 34:46.042
Your Majesty.

34:46.918 --> 34:47.919
Go…

34:49.504 --> 34:50.964
and protect His Majesty.

34:51.589 --> 34:52.674
Yes, Your Majesty.
:cue

35:25.415 --> 35:26.416
Jeongwoo.

35:34.007 --> 35:35.133
Did you really…

35:38.553 --> 35:39.554
try to…

35:43.141 --> 35:44.392
Try to kill you?

35:51.399 --> 35:52.400
Yeah.

36:06.414 --> 36:07.415
Why?

36:15.548 --> 36:16.633
I begged you.

36:21.429 --> 36:23.098
I begged you to push Huiju away.

36:25.141 --> 36:27.060
I told you I'd protect you if you did.

36:28.561 --> 36:29.688
Time and time again.

36:58.508 --> 36:59.551
It's your fault…

37:02.345 --> 37:03.471
I turned out this way.

37:23.658 --> 37:25.118
It's your fault for thinking…

37:31.332 --> 37:33.168
I took her when she was never yours.

38:38.900 --> 38:39.901
Are you okay?

38:42.737 --> 38:43.738
What about you?

38:57.168 --> 38:58.253
You did well.

39:12.267 --> 39:14.601
For the first time
in constitutional history,

39:14.602 --> 39:16.854
a nationwide referendum

39:16.855 --> 39:19.815
on the future of the monarchy
commenced at 8:00 a.m. today.

39:19.816 --> 39:22.317
This vote, which stands
to fundamentally reshape the relationship

39:22.318 --> 39:24.945
between the monarchy,
the government, and the people,
:cue

39:24.946 --> 39:29.157
is being widely regarded
as a defining moment for the nation.

39:29.158 --> 39:32.619
Following extensive negotiations,
the Crown and the government have agreed

39:32.620 --> 39:36.790
to put the question of abolishing
the monarchy to a public vote.

39:36.791 --> 39:38.625
Ultimately, His Majesty's principle

39:38.626 --> 39:42.588
that the people must decide
whether the monarchy is retained

39:42.589 --> 39:44.923
or abolished has prevailed.

39:48.386 --> 39:49.762
What would you want to do first

39:51.014 --> 39:52.181
if it passes?

39:53.558 --> 39:54.684
Hmm.

39:56.561 --> 39:57.562
My name.

39:58.313 --> 39:59.314
Your name?

40:00.273 --> 40:01.274
Do you know my name?

40:02.066 --> 40:05.612
You think I don't know
my own husband's name?

40:06.237 --> 40:07.322
You've never used it.

40:07.822 --> 40:09.282
That's because royals…

40:09.824 --> 40:10.825
Exactly.

40:12.452 --> 40:13.453
So…

40:14.954 --> 40:17.707
if it passes, I want you to call me…

40:19.125 --> 40:20.126
by my name.

40:23.671 --> 40:24.672
I will.

40:54.869 --> 40:56.037
It's the weekend.

40:58.373 --> 41:00.959
You should go
to the private residence and rest too.

41:02.043 --> 41:05.755
Well, I'm most at ease
at the palace.

41:11.386 --> 41:13.304
The thought of abolishing the monarchy

41:14.305 --> 41:15.848
must make you a little sad.

41:17.433 --> 41:18.434
Why?

41:21.729 --> 41:23.939
The palace is home to you.

41:25.942 --> 41:29.278
Come on. Your family doesn't change
just because you move.

41:29.862 --> 41:33.700
I'll still have
His Majesty and Her Majesty.

41:36.828 --> 41:37.829
And you

41:39.038 --> 41:42.166
will be there as well.

41:43.084 --> 41:44.085
Right?

41:53.261 --> 41:54.720
Hyeon, you have something here.

41:54.721 --> 41:55.930
Come closer.

42:05.231 --> 42:07.066
Why? Am I moving too fast? Bad idea?

42:11.821 --> 42:12.822
Good idea.

42:36.846 --> 42:38.931
Oh, my goodness.

42:41.309 --> 42:42.852
That's youth for you.

42:44.103 --> 42:45.646
My goodness.

42:47.648 --> 42:48.733
Let's go already!

43:01.079 --> 43:02.121
So cute.

43:12.715 --> 43:14.175
That hurts.

43:14.967 --> 43:16.052
How about

43:16.844 --> 43:17.845
when spring comes,

43:18.971 --> 43:20.598
we go see the cherry blossoms?

43:22.892 --> 43:23.893
Sounds good.

43:29.649 --> 43:30.774
You're so short.

43:30.775 --> 43:33.819
When we go see the cherry blossoms,
I'm going to lift you up

43:33.820 --> 43:36.863
and carry you around like this.

43:36.864 --> 43:38.198
Just like this.

43:38.199 --> 43:39.617
:cue

43:53.381 --> 43:55.298
Thus proclaims the King.

43:55.299 --> 43:57.093
THUS PROCLAIMS THE KING

43:58.177 --> 43:59.553
For many years,

43:59.554 --> 44:02.390
this nation has maintained stability
through the Crown.

44:04.016 --> 44:06.394
At times, it offered protection.

44:07.728 --> 44:08.729
At others,

44:09.522 --> 44:11.232
it hindered progress.

44:13.568 --> 44:18.239
The people have spoken and have decided
to bear full responsibility themselves.

44:19.282 --> 44:20.616
In light of their decision,

44:21.117 --> 44:22.118
the Crown

44:24.036 --> 44:25.830
can no longer claim justification.

44:26.414 --> 44:29.124
By the final authority

44:29.125 --> 44:31.002
vested in me by the Constitution,

44:32.170 --> 44:33.796
I hereby proclaim the abolition…

44:35.798 --> 44:36.799
of the monarchy.

44:39.886 --> 44:41.095
The 34th King,

44:42.263 --> 44:43.347
Lee Wan.

45:29.227 --> 45:30.603
Huiju!

45:37.818 --> 45:38.819
Wan!

45:42.323 --> 45:43.449
Lee Wan!

46:11.519 --> 46:12.728
- Let's go.
- Okay.

46:36.252 --> 46:40.589
THREE YEARS LATER

46:51.434 --> 46:52.518
Over here!

46:58.316 --> 46:59.941
It has been three years

46:59.942 --> 47:01.818
since Ms. Seong
left her company for the palace.

47:01.819 --> 47:04.237
She has now returned
to the board to resume

47:04.238 --> 47:06.073
a frontline management role.

47:10.828 --> 47:12.620
Industry insiders believe

47:12.621 --> 47:16.542
her return will significantly impact
Castle Group's succession dynamics.

47:17.043 --> 47:18.418
As the nation's last queen

47:18.419 --> 47:21.212
and a leading figure
in the abolition of the monarchy,

47:21.213 --> 47:25.800
there is growing interest in what changes
she will bring to Castle Group.

47:25.801 --> 47:27.177
CASTLE BEAUTY CEO SEONG HUIJU

47:27.178 --> 47:28.596
How have you been?

47:33.142 --> 47:34.310
I missed you so much.

47:34.935 --> 47:36.103
Are you really that happy?

47:41.192 --> 47:42.193
Move.

47:43.152 --> 47:44.153
:cue

47:50.618 --> 47:52.286
It has been far too long.

47:56.582 --> 47:59.877
Let's just say you've been on sabbatical.

48:00.378 --> 48:02.837
Don't you think I work too hard
abolishing the monarchy

48:02.838 --> 48:03.964
for it to count as one?

48:06.717 --> 48:07.802
What? Hold on.

48:08.552 --> 48:09.553
What is all this?

48:10.054 --> 48:12.472
Senior Managing Director
Seong's projects.

48:12.473 --> 48:14.391
You asked me to organize
all related files.

48:14.392 --> 48:15.643
Why are there so many?

48:16.227 --> 48:17.770
He worked on a ton of projects.

48:21.982 --> 48:23.109
What in the world?

48:25.653 --> 48:27.070
ADVERTISEMENT MODEL, SEONG TAEJU

48:27.071 --> 48:29.031
He made himself the face of the brand?

48:29.573 --> 48:32.701
Who in their right mind would buy this?

48:36.038 --> 48:37.832
- Hello, sir.
- Hi, Ms. Do.

48:38.582 --> 48:40.041
- Taeju.
- Yes?

48:40.042 --> 48:43.795
I'm currently reviewing
your project proposals, you see.

48:43.796 --> 48:46.047
- This is…
- No need to thank me.

48:46.048 --> 48:48.383
Can you just do me a favor?

48:48.384 --> 48:51.010
You're going to ask
for a favor too?

48:51.011 --> 48:53.681
I need you to manage Castle Card as well.

48:56.225 --> 48:57.226
What?

48:59.311 --> 49:01.897
Then, what will you be doing?

49:03.065 --> 49:04.941
Did Father ask you to go to Electronics?

49:04.942 --> 49:07.862
Don't kid yourself.
He's not retiring anytime soon.

49:10.698 --> 49:11.699
Then why?

49:13.534 --> 49:15.369
How do I say this?

49:16.370 --> 49:17.371
Listen.

49:17.913 --> 49:19.290
My Dayeong is pregnant.

49:21.584 --> 49:22.585
What?

49:23.294 --> 49:25.463
You're going to be an aunt, kid.

49:26.213 --> 49:28.299
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

49:29.008 --> 49:30.091
So?

49:30.092 --> 49:32.552
What do you mean?
I need to go on paternity leave.

49:32.553 --> 49:34.472
She can't do all that by herself.

49:39.143 --> 49:41.728
Have you lost your freaking mind?

49:41.729 --> 49:43.813
- Get back here!
- I'll take that as a yes!

49:43.814 --> 49:45.274
Thanks, I appreciate it!

49:57.077 --> 49:58.786
You should just give up on cooking.

49:58.787 --> 50:00.455
Clearly, this isn't your strong suit.

50:00.456 --> 50:02.708
Hey, like you were so great
from the start?

50:03.292 --> 50:04.667
Yes, I was actually.

50:04.668 --> 50:05.669
Really?

50:10.341 --> 50:11.342
By the way,

50:12.635 --> 50:14.428
when are you planning to go back to work?

50:16.639 --> 50:19.891
I mean, you set up a whole foundation
after sorting out the royal assets.

50:19.892 --> 50:22.019
Are you just never going to
show up for work?

50:23.312 --> 50:24.605
I just need a little longer.

50:26.357 --> 50:27.942
I used to work day and night.

50:28.776 --> 50:30.319
I can take a bit more time off.

50:31.320 --> 50:33.447
I can review the key documents from home.

50:34.823 --> 50:35.866
But you know,

50:36.617 --> 50:39.203
most women aren't into guys
who don't have a job.

50:40.120 --> 50:41.788
- Really?
- Of course.

50:41.789 --> 50:44.332
I mean, look at how hard your wife
is working at her job.

50:44.333 --> 50:45.334
While you…

50:46.794 --> 50:49.713
If you just bum around the house all day,
it's not a good look.

50:50.256 --> 50:52.507
Hey, I'm not "bumming around."

50:52.508 --> 50:53.591
I'm resting.

50:53.592 --> 50:55.719
That's the same difference… sir.

50:56.595 --> 50:58.596
Why, you…

50:58.597 --> 50:59.974
Unbelievable.

51:03.519 --> 51:04.520
Hey, Huiju.

51:05.145 --> 51:06.647
I'm cooking dinner.

51:07.940 --> 51:09.191
Are you on your way home?

51:10.067 --> 51:12.778
I don't think I can join you
for dinner today.

51:13.737 --> 51:15.781
Why not? Did something happen?

51:16.407 --> 51:18.075
No, it's nothing like that.

51:19.660 --> 51:21.536
I actually have another call coming in.

51:21.537 --> 51:23.913
Ms. Do won't be able to join you either.

51:23.914 --> 51:25.290
You two should eat without us.

51:25.291 --> 51:26.292
I have to go now.

51:26.875 --> 51:28.167
Wait. Hold on, babe.

51:28.168 --> 51:29.460
You're telling me this now?

51:29.461 --> 51:30.629
Hello? Babe?

51:32.172 --> 51:35.258
Why? Is she too busy for you?

51:35.259 --> 51:37.177
Yeah. Ms. Do also can't make it.

51:41.181 --> 51:42.850
I didn't see her yesterday either.

51:44.268 --> 51:45.269
I didn't either.

51:48.522 --> 51:49.857
:cue

51:52.318 --> 51:53.401
Hello there.

51:53.402 --> 51:55.403
I worked hard on that dinner.

51:55.404 --> 51:56.488
Why are we eating out?

51:57.072 --> 51:58.448
Wan, check your conscience.

51:58.449 --> 52:00.158
Who'd eat that? You want diabetes?

52:00.159 --> 52:02.201
- Why you little…
- Do you want to try that?

52:02.202 --> 52:03.287
- That one?
- Yeah.

52:07.541 --> 52:08.792
Mmm.

52:19.887 --> 52:21.262
What's with that face?

52:21.263 --> 52:22.347
What?

52:22.348 --> 52:24.641
It's nothing. I'm glad you're enjoying it.

52:24.642 --> 52:25.643
Is it tasty?

52:26.477 --> 52:27.602
It is.

52:28.771 --> 52:29.897
Hold on a second.

52:30.648 --> 52:32.190
That's new.

52:32.191 --> 52:34.025
It's nothing. Hyejeong kept saying

52:34.026 --> 52:36.736
she wanted this
to celebrate our third anniversary.

52:36.737 --> 52:38.155
You like it?

52:39.198 --> 52:40.406
It's not bad.

52:40.407 --> 52:42.993
- Wait, your third anniversary?
- Yeah.

52:44.453 --> 52:46.120
You guys should be hitting it soon.

52:46.121 --> 52:47.455
No, we're past that.

52:47.456 --> 52:48.499
When did you two start?

52:49.625 --> 52:50.917
Start?

52:50.918 --> 52:53.336
Come on. You know it was
all fake in the beginning.

52:53.337 --> 52:54.588
Watch it!

52:58.634 --> 53:00.009
It wasn't all fake.

53:00.010 --> 53:01.762
It wasn't all real, either.

53:06.600 --> 53:08.227
Maybe you can redo the proposal?

53:08.769 --> 53:09.770
Pro…

53:10.646 --> 53:12.522
- Proposal?
- Yeah.

53:12.523 --> 53:14.817
You don't even have
a wedding band.

53:20.656 --> 53:22.157
Proposal…

53:24.451 --> 53:26.411
Hello, Court Lady Choi. I mean, Jinsook.

53:26.412 --> 53:27.413
I'm listening.

53:29.373 --> 53:30.374
Wait, where are you?

53:36.505 --> 53:37.631
Come in.

53:43.929 --> 53:44.930
Father?

53:51.270 --> 53:52.813
I spoke with Taeju.

53:54.773 --> 53:56.024
Just prove yourself.

53:58.569 --> 54:00.696
I'll make sure the cards

54:01.447 --> 54:02.656
aren't stacked against you.

54:23.343 --> 54:24.344
Huiju.

54:27.723 --> 54:29.683
I never wanted you to lose.

54:31.185 --> 54:33.771
I just wanted you
to stop fighting everyone.

54:39.735 --> 54:40.736
Now…

54:42.905 --> 54:44.281
I won't stop you.

55:22.486 --> 55:23.737
Why would you

55:24.446 --> 55:25.613
gift us a bed?

55:27.366 --> 55:28.367
Just come.

55:29.451 --> 55:32.621
- Try sitting on it, Your Majesty.
- Stop calling me that already.

55:34.414 --> 55:35.415
:cue

55:37.626 --> 55:38.627
Here we go.

55:41.129 --> 55:42.130
A bed…

55:43.465 --> 55:45.592
It's quite soft.

55:49.096 --> 55:50.389
- Oh. Ooh.
- Ooh.

55:54.977 --> 55:56.395
Is it not comfortable?

55:58.397 --> 55:59.564
It is.

55:59.565 --> 56:01.816
I hear it will help you sleep very well.

56:01.817 --> 56:03.277
He sleeps fine now.

56:06.530 --> 56:08.991
It has been over three years
since your marriage,

56:09.700 --> 56:11.826
but there is still no news of an heir.

56:14.037 --> 56:17.665
I was hoping a precious bed
could lead to some precious news.

56:19.418 --> 56:20.543
Precious news.

56:20.544 --> 56:23.337
There will never be precious news.
They're both DINKs.

56:23.338 --> 56:25.464
- Choi Hyeon!
- DINK?

56:25.465 --> 56:28.843
Well, Huiju just started working again.

56:28.844 --> 56:29.927
And I…

56:29.928 --> 56:32.096
Is there something wrong with His Majesty?

56:32.097 --> 56:33.390
I said, I'm not a majesty!

56:34.641 --> 56:35.642
Follow me.

56:36.143 --> 56:37.978
No, wait… And also!

56:39.062 --> 56:40.397
I'm in tip-top shape!

56:54.911 --> 56:56.955
Oh, my gosh!

56:57.831 --> 56:59.041
You scared me.

57:00.584 --> 57:02.043
Why aren't you sleeping?

57:02.044 --> 57:03.545
My wife wasn't home.

57:04.171 --> 57:06.714
How could I, as your husband, just sleep?

57:08.842 --> 57:10.593
Sorry. You can go to bed now.

57:10.594 --> 57:11.637
Hold on.

57:14.181 --> 57:15.307
Did you need something?

57:16.516 --> 57:17.643
No, I…

57:19.853 --> 57:22.189
Seong Taeju told me
he's going to take some time off.

57:23.190 --> 57:24.566
I might be a bit busier now.

57:25.525 --> 57:26.609
All of a sudden? Why?

57:26.610 --> 57:28.362
He said Dayeong is pregnant.

57:29.196 --> 57:30.404
What?

57:30.405 --> 57:35.242
You know how professional executives
in this country are a dime a dozen?

57:35.243 --> 57:37.870
But he just had to…

57:37.871 --> 57:40.665
He just had to pick me

57:40.666 --> 57:42.917
and ask me to take over.

57:42.918 --> 57:45.587
Brother? More like a pain in the ass.

57:48.006 --> 57:49.007
You seem excited.

57:51.385 --> 57:55.013
Castle Card has
all the cash in Castle Group.

57:57.974 --> 57:58.975
I'm going to wash up.

58:24.084 --> 58:25.085
Should I get one?

58:26.420 --> 58:27.421
What?

58:29.548 --> 58:30.590
A ring.

58:31.842 --> 58:33.677
What ring?

58:34.511 --> 58:35.512
You know…

58:36.805 --> 58:38.265
Most husbands

58:39.015 --> 58:41.017
wear a wedding band.

58:41.643 --> 58:42.644
Well…

58:45.272 --> 58:46.605
Why bother?

58:46.606 --> 58:47.941
What?

58:51.778 --> 58:53.029
Why bother?

58:55.866 --> 58:56.867
Seong Huiju.

58:59.619 --> 59:00.620
Huiju.

59:02.998 --> 59:04.290
Babe.

59:04.291 --> 59:05.833
Ms. Seong. Ms. Junior Alum.

59:05.834 --> 59:07.377
Hello?

59:07.961 --> 59:08.962
Seong…

59:12.632 --> 59:13.633
You're asleep.
:cue

59:24.811 --> 59:26.563
He was fussing over the cello last time.

59:27.355 --> 59:29.024
Now, it's the violin?

59:29.941 --> 59:32.485
He doesn't like the piano or the cello.

59:32.486 --> 59:33.987
Can't seem to find what he likes.

59:35.530 --> 59:36.782
Maybe he doesn't like music?

59:38.700 --> 59:41.619
My Yun will become a musician.

59:41.620 --> 59:42.870
Don't say such things.

59:44.581 --> 59:46.290
You know it's not that easy.

59:50.837 --> 59:52.255
Let me buy this one for him.

59:52.881 --> 59:54.800
Tell him it's a gift from his uncle.

59:55.926 --> 59:57.969
Then, please buy this one for him.

59:58.720 --> 01:00:00.514
- We'll take this one.
- This one?

01:00:02.140 --> 01:00:04.934
Hold on… How much is it?

01:00:04.935 --> 01:00:06.311
I'll ring it right up for you.

01:00:07.145 --> 01:00:08.730
Thanks.

01:00:10.398 --> 01:00:12.149
DREAM INSTRUMENTS

01:00:12.150 --> 01:00:14.569
We can have dinner together
when Yun gets out of school.

01:00:16.029 --> 01:00:18.031
No. He has to go to his math academy.

01:00:19.574 --> 01:00:21.201
He attends an academy too?

01:00:23.954 --> 01:00:26.122
Right, as he should.

01:00:27.624 --> 01:00:30.168
He should. He's almost out
of elementary school now.

01:00:40.512 --> 01:00:42.138
Get back safely, Wan.

01:00:43.098 --> 01:00:45.183
Thanks. You too, Irang.

01:01:04.953 --> 01:01:07.204
HYEON'S GARDEN

01:01:07.205 --> 01:01:11.166
So, you're going to propose
to her again?

01:01:11.167 --> 01:01:13.879
You made a good point last time.

01:01:15.881 --> 01:01:17.256
I see.

01:01:17.257 --> 01:01:19.301
We could get new rings.

01:01:19.926 --> 01:01:21.760
A fresh proposal would be nice too.

01:01:21.761 --> 01:01:23.221
Huiju. Behind you.

01:01:23.763 --> 01:01:24.764
What?

01:01:40.864 --> 01:01:41.865
Did you hear that?

01:01:51.583 --> 01:01:54.586
Did you bring up the ring last night
because of the proposal?

01:01:58.173 --> 01:02:00.382
I mean, you know. It was more like…

01:02:00.383 --> 01:02:04.387
For a second there,
I thought you were suddenly into jewelry.

01:02:06.514 --> 01:02:08.475
You don't want to wear a wedding dress?

01:02:09.851 --> 01:02:10.852
Why bother?

01:02:13.355 --> 01:02:14.356
You know,

01:02:14.940 --> 01:02:16.941
you've been saying that a lot recently.

01:02:16.942 --> 01:02:19.151
But to say "why bother" about our wedding?

01:02:19.152 --> 01:02:20.570
There's no room for "why bother"s!

01:02:21.196 --> 01:02:24.031
But we already did all that.
Why would we do it again?

01:02:24.032 --> 01:02:25.574
But back then we were…

01:02:25.575 --> 01:02:27.452
That's when I started
having real feelings.

01:02:28.495 --> 01:02:29.496
What?

01:02:32.958 --> 01:02:34.501
I guess it wasn't the same for you.

01:02:39.798 --> 01:02:40.799
Babe…

01:02:41.716 --> 01:02:43.426
Hold on. Babe.

01:02:46.262 --> 01:02:48.765
Wait, you're saying
that's when you started?

01:02:50.266 --> 01:02:51.643
That late?

01:02:52.727 --> 01:02:55.479
We kissed and stuff way before then.

01:02:55.480 --> 01:02:56.982
When did you start?

01:02:58.733 --> 01:02:59.943
What?

01:03:28.596 --> 01:03:30.765
When did you start
having real feelings for me?
:cue

01:03:36.438 --> 01:03:37.439
From the start.

01:03:39.733 --> 01:03:40.734
You didn't know?

01:03:42.527 --> 01:03:44.446
I started liking you way back when.

01:03:45.405 --> 01:03:46.406
Way back when?

01:03:47.365 --> 01:03:49.951
Exactly how long ago is way back when?

01:03:50.827 --> 01:03:53.705
When you first told me your name.

01:03:54.706 --> 01:03:55.832
Who goes there?

01:03:59.169 --> 01:04:00.462
Your name.

01:04:01.546 --> 01:04:02.964
It is Seong Huiju.

01:04:05.800 --> 01:04:08.303
Back at that archery range?

01:04:11.347 --> 01:04:13.141
You were like a bright ember in the dark.

01:04:14.517 --> 01:04:15.685
I wanted to run after you.

01:04:17.645 --> 01:04:18.980
Since you were so popular,

01:04:19.981 --> 01:04:22.067
I kept hearing about you at school

01:04:23.109 --> 01:04:24.444
and even after graduation.

01:04:25.403 --> 01:04:27.906
I thought we'd run
into each other eventually,

01:04:29.449 --> 01:04:30.742
but it never happened.

01:04:31.409 --> 01:04:33.787
- Then, I saw you at…
- The Royal Birthday Banquet.

01:04:46.174 --> 01:04:48.551
You were just as bright an ember
that day.

01:04:51.888 --> 01:04:52.889
So you ran after me?

01:05:09.114 --> 01:05:10.115
Yeah.

01:05:11.116 --> 01:05:13.868
As fast as I could
because I was afraid of losing you.

01:05:30.135 --> 01:05:32.387
THE CROWN'S FINAL DUTY

01:06:29.152 --> 01:06:31.154
It was not mine when I wanted it.

01:06:33.031 --> 01:06:34.365
It was mine…

01:06:36.409 --> 01:06:37.492
when I did not want it.

01:06:40.330 --> 01:06:41.539
But in the end,

01:06:42.749 --> 01:06:44.000
it was my choice.

01:06:58.973 --> 01:06:59.974
I feel relieved.

01:07:17.283 --> 01:07:18.326
Babe!

01:07:20.745 --> 01:07:21.995
Sorry!

01:07:21.996 --> 01:07:24.999
I'm sorry. Work took forever.

01:07:25.625 --> 01:07:28.503
Are you done with the exhibit?
We can look at it some more.

01:07:30.713 --> 01:07:31.923
No, it's fine.

01:07:33.675 --> 01:07:34.926
Let's go.

01:07:35.510 --> 01:07:36.761
Let's go.

01:07:48.523 --> 01:07:50.983
:cue

01:07:50.984 --> 01:07:53.652
I'm going to eat this
in one bite.

01:07:53.653 --> 01:07:55.196
Wan, over here!

01:07:56.531 --> 01:07:58.073
Hurry up.

01:07:58.074 --> 01:07:59.075
Ms. Seong!

01:08:00.368 --> 01:08:01.369
Hmm.

01:08:03.121 --> 01:08:04.122
Let's wear them too.

01:08:05.039 --> 01:08:07.166
The jersey? You want to wear one?

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:09.377
Yeah. I like jerseys.

01:08:12.005 --> 01:08:13.130
Let's go.

01:08:13.131 --> 01:08:14.756
-  Hi!
-  Let's go.

01:08:14.757 --> 01:08:17.176
Huh? Okay, let's go.

01:08:18.344 --> 01:08:19.469
ALL SEATS SOLD OUT

01:08:20.555 --> 01:08:21.597
It's starting.

01:08:24.767 --> 01:08:26.101
- I have one too.
- Like this?

01:08:31.399 --> 01:08:33.276
Castle Sharks! Yeah!

01:08:37.238 --> 01:08:38.363
Let's go!

01:08:41.784 --> 01:08:43.243
Are you kidding me right now?

01:08:43.244 --> 01:08:44.786
You must be joking!

01:08:44.787 --> 01:08:50.335
Shark attack! Let's go, Castle Sharks!

01:08:58.426 --> 01:08:59.552
Why am I not getting any?

01:09:00.261 --> 01:09:02.512
- What the…
- What?

01:09:02.513 --> 01:09:04.349
That's us!

01:09:04.849 --> 01:09:06.434
Us? Let's do it.

01:09:09.479 --> 01:09:13.940
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

01:09:13.941 --> 01:09:16.277
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

01:09:16.861 --> 01:09:17.862
Sorry.

01:09:19.655 --> 01:09:20.823
Should we speed things up?

01:09:24.243 --> 01:09:25.912
We don't need to maintain decorum now?

01:09:26.496 --> 01:09:28.289
Yeah. No more decorum.

01:09:54.023 --> 01:09:58.277
One more time!
One more time!

01:09:59.529 --> 01:10:01.571
- One more time!
- One more time!

01:10:02.657 --> 01:10:05.576
PERFECT CROWN

01:11:50.890 --> 01:11:52.974
Translated by Justin S. Kim

01:11:52.975 --> 01:11:56.687
PERFECT CROWN
